# No agent-driven UI testing

UI and browser checks are done manually by the developers. Agents must not:

- Start local servers (`python -m http.server`, `flutter run`, `flutter run -d web-server`, etc.)
- Open, drive, or screenshot the app in a browser (browser tools, CDP, device emulation)

Verify work only with:

- `flutter analyze`
- `flutter test`
- `flutter build web` (when a build check is needed)

When an iteration is done, give the developers 3-5 short manual test steps instead.
